hislaha/9-Pebbles","owner":"ashislaha","html_url":"https://github.com/ashislaha/9-Pebbles","stars":4,"forks":4,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Swift","description":"9-Pebbles :   Description : This is very simple game played by 2 players. You can play offline 2 players or play with Computer.  Initially 9 pebbles are given to both player. Aim is to create a Straight Line either Horizontally or Vertically. When a Straight line is created, you claim a pebble from Opposition that must not belongs to a Straight line.  When all pebbles are placed on desk, single movements starts. You will get 4 options \"Left\"/\"Right\"/\"Top\"/\"Bottom\" to move your pebble to create a Straight line.  When you claim all pebbles from opposition then you will win the game.  I added \"Online\" feature for simple conversation with online users. But for that, you have to login with your google account. Enjoy :-)","topics":["authentication","firebase","game"],"score":284441,"global_rank":30721},{"name":"garykac/3d-cubes","owner":"garykac","html_url":"https://github.com/garykac/3d-cubes","stars":29,"forks":2,"watchers":1,"issues":1,"language":"Other","description":"Simple 3d cube in various formats","topics":[],"score":284435,"global_rank":30723},{"name":"ChristopherJMiller/bandcamp-sync","owner":"ChristopherJMiller","html_url":"https://github.com/ChristopherJMiller/bandcamp-sync","stars":4,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":2,"language":"Rust","description":"A CLI to sync a bandcamp collection to local/remote destinations","topics":[],"score":284425,"global_rank":30728},{"name":"aelxxs/alexis","owner":"aelxxs","html_url":"https://github.com/aelxxs/alexis","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Astro","description":"\ud83c\udf61 \u2013 Personal site built with Astro","topics":[],"score":284424,"global_rank":30732},{"name":"creachadair/mazegen","owner":"creachadair","html_url":"https://github.com/creachadair/mazegen","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C","